Subject: [PATCH 3/4] gpu: Add msm Adreno device telemetry

Recognize msm, msm_dpu and adreno DRM devices. Locate the Adreno
component when the DRM parent is the display controller, and derive its
name from the device-tree compatible. Read current and maximum frequency
from devfreq and the highest readable gpuss thermal-zone temperature.

Expose maximum frequency in the existing clock row tooltip, reusing the
CPU page translation. Keep missing current frequency unavailable rather
than substituting the maximum. GPU usage follows the existing fdinfo
aggregation path enabled by the preceding process-data change.

Cover Adreno 830 and X1-85 names, a DPU-owned card1, current/max frequency,
CPU sensor exclusion and ambiguous multiple Adreno devices in tests.

Related: https://github.com/nokyan/resources/issues/623

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
